== condition restless
name: Restless
shows: Your restless mind keeps you awake.
blocks rest: yes
rest refusal: Your restless mind will not let you sleep.

== condition nimble
name: Nimble
while active:
    player.dexterity + 3

== feat echo
name: Echo metadata

== condition echo
name: Echo
while active:
    player.dexterity + 1
ends:
    The echo fades.
    ---
    Silence returns.
